OL,3,GNEWSAFuel prices leave people asking
OL,4,A'what can we do?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecord fuel prices across the country
OL,7,Fhave left people in the south of
OL,8,FEngland looking for ways to cope with
OL,9,Fthe rising costs.
OL,11,FEarlier this week, the RAC said diesel
OL,12,Fprices in the UK had reached an all
OL,13,Ftime high, with the cost of petrol also
OL,14,Frising, due to the ongoing conflict in
OL,15,Fthe Middle East.
OL,17,FOne garage manager from Berkshire said
OL,18,Fhe had noticed a change in customer
OL,19,Fbehaviour, with customers more likely
OL,20,Fto put #20 of fuel in, rather than fill
OL,21,Ftheir tanks up.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
