OL,3,GNEWSAFuel prices leave people asking
OL,4,A'what can we do?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, a small charity helping
OL,7,Fpeople with multiple sclerosis (MS) in
OL,8,FDorset said it would have to find ways
OL,9,Fto cut costs, as it was now costing an
OL,10,Fextra #2,000 a year to run a key
OL,11,Fminibus service.
